        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Kinison\n- Products: Leader of the Banned\n- Topics: comedy albums, stand-up comedy, acting, Pentecostal preaching\n\nFacts:\n- Sam Kinison was born on December 8, 1953, and he was an American stand-up comedian and actor.\n- Sam Kinison was a former Pentecostal preacher before his stand-up comedy career.\n- Sam Kinison’s stand-up routines were characterized by an intense style similar to charismatic preachers and were punctuated by his trademark scream.\n- Leader of the Banned was Sam Kinison’s third comedy album, and it was released in 1990.\n- Sam Kinison died on April 10, 1992.",
